Description: Secret Service D-Bus API backed by pass (upstream source build)
 Implements the org.freedesktop.secrets D-Bus interface (as used by
 libsecret-consuming apps, e.g. Firefox saved logins) with pass(1) as the
 storage backend, in place of gnome-keyring.
 .
 Auto-started on demand via D-Bus session-bus activation
 (org.freedesktop.secrets.service); no manual startup required once a
 pass(1) store exists.
 .
 This package builds an upstream source snapshot rather than repackaging a
 release, since pass-secret-service has no tagged releases.
